#101
"Before the Great Temple of Medienne"
"The Great Temple of Medienne rises to the north, an impressive structure in

pale gold stone.  Wide, flat stairs of the same hue lead up to a set of large,

ironoak double doors.  In the middle of the path leading to the stairs is a

fountain cast in the softly-colored gold stone.  The statue is of Algesa,

standing proudly and holding before her the blade she is known for.  There is

not much ornamentation upon the structure itself, lending the entire facade an

air of unadorned elegance.

"
""
