E
"statue fountain Algesa"
"Beautifully crafted out of pale golden stone, this masterwork of the

sculptor's art serves both form and function.  The scales are balanced

perfectly upon Algesa's blade, Divine Justice, and the chain linking them to

the balance is so delicate it seems to be actually crafted of metal.  The

water rises forth from the hilt of the sword, flowing down the balance and the

chains to catch in the plates of the scales before falling to the main basin

at Algesa's feet.

"
