#102
"North Temple Road"
"The large stones fitted together to make up this street are very worn from

both weather and frequent travel.  To the north, a large temple rises up

impressively.  On either side of the street are two shops that match each

other conveniently: a weapon shop and an armory.  The street continues to a

few more shops further south.

