#103
"North Temple Road"
"North Temple Road intersects with Medienne Avenue not far to the south and

continues towards the temple to the north.  To the east is a grocery store

with a display of traveller's lamps in the window.  The store to the west is

fancier and appears to deal in fine jewelry.  There appear to be more stores

on this street closer to the temple.

