#104
"Intersection of Temple and Medienne"
"This is the intersection of North Temple Road and Medienne Avenue.  The east-

west running avenue was named after the town and leads past store fronts and

eventually to the residential districts.  Temple Road is lined with more busy

shops to both the north and the south.  All of the stores around this

intersection make it a very crowded place at nearly all times of the day and

night.

"
