"Temple Road"
"This cobbled road continues north, but to the south is what looks like a small

sooty park at the central intersection of town.  To the west is a rundown

building, wide wooden doors open to reveal a stable.  Opposite it is a candy

shop, sparkling white with pink trim around the windows and doorway.

