#107
"Cross Roads of Medienne"
"This is the central square of Medienne, the intersection of Main Street and

Temple Road, a sort of miniature park.  A large marble fountain sits at the

center of this intersection; around it four small flower gardens flourish.

Small shrubs, carefully sculpted into spheres, grow at each corner of the

square, standing at only three feet in height.

"
