#111
"Main Street"
"The building to the north was once a famous inn among travellers of all kinds

but now it stands empty and abandoned, without anyone caring enough about it

to even shut the door to keep trouble-makers out.  It's sign hangs askew, the

words scratched and worn by weather beyond readability.  To the south is a

small pet shop, obvious before even looking at it's sign from the sounds of

animals within.

"
