#112
"Main Street"
"Main street nears its end here, crossing with Manor Street to the north, and

the eastern gate of Medienne is just a short distance away.  To the west, it

seems to be lined with tall walls and to the north is a series of fairly large

houses.  Further south, the street quickly becomes very unpleasant looking and

ends in the city dump.

