#113
"East Gate of Medienne"
"The towers to either side of the gate are massive from repeated reinforcements

with layer after layer of stone.  By now it would take an all-out attack by

several kingdoms allied to bring these towers down and the gate itself is made

of massive wooden logs that seem too large to even have come from the trees of

Medienne forest.

