#117
"North End of Celemn Road"
"Celemn Road ends here with a trio of houses.  The house to the east is small

and it's garden quite neglected.  The western home looks very wealthy in

comparison, with gold-colored curtains and a large gold-plated door knocker.

The north house weirdly looks almost brand new, though that is surely

impossible.  The road intersects another not far south from here.

"
