#121
"Intersection of Manor and Medienne"
"The cobblestones of the street around here are almost shine from their

cleanliness, as if some obsessive street cleaner must devote his life to this

piece of the city.  Not far to the west, the street becomes very crowded, but

little of that crowd comes to this part of the city.  The high-class Manor

Road continues to the north and south and a large mansion stands beyond a

large, impressive gate to the east.

 

A prominent-looking @b@Rsign@n is posted on the gate.

