#122
"Manor Road"
"The houses along Manor Road are large and sturdy, with thick looking oak doors

and windows several feet higher above the ground than most houses are

designed.  The house to the west is quite colorful, with orange and white

curtains hanging in the window which is surrounded by a deep green trim.  It

is stunning to observe, though perhaps not in the same way the owner intended.

