#123
"Manor Road"
"Eastward lies a house that looks plain when compared to the estates situated

near it.  The small patch of grass that serves as a lawn is yellowed from the

sun and neglect, and the few embellishments decorating the windows and door

are coated with faded, flaking paint.  To the west, an equally unremarkable

plain stone wall spans another lot.  Manor Road continues north and south from

here.

