"Manor Road"
"This desolate alleyway does not seem to be a part of the rest of Manor Road at

all.  There is a foul smell coming from beyond the tall, plain gate to the

south and to the east is a huge, intimidating tower without any windows to be

seen.  To the west there is a tall, plain wall and you cannot see what lies

beyond it.

