#138
"The Cracked Crown"
"This cozy, dark, smokey tavern is devoted to the adventurer and traveler. 

Here they can order large meals to fill their stomachs, or just sit back and

lift tankards of rare ale, and the locals know this as the best place to hear

the latest news and tales from the lands beyond their secluded horizon.  In

the center of the room is a blazing fire in a circular stone hearth, the heat

determined to drive the cold and damp from your bones.  A flight of stairs

lead up from a doorway behind the bar, but customers aren't allowed behind the

bar.

     There is a sign posted above the bar here.

