converted to a stable.  A weatherworn counter still stands shoved up against

the dusty, whitewashed wall.  The shopfront to the east has been replaced with

large wooden doors, and the floor has been strewn with tattered hay.

Throughout the building, stalls have been constructed of fresh timber.

