#147
"The Rusty Nail"
"This is a dark, dangerous tavern, filled with the lower filth of society.  It

is here where the really brave adventurer comes.  There are endless kegs of

ale and other fine spirits.  There is also an endless group of people waiting

to slit your throat when you least expect it.  The room itself is poorly lit

and smells like it hasn't been cleaned in years.  A dagger protruding from the

wall gleams in the soft light, sending an errant reflection around the darkly

shadowed room.

