"dagger"
"This blackened dagger appears to be of fine quality, the visible blade, that

part which has not been jammed through the wooden wall, is nick-free while its

pommel is fairly ornate, fashioned in the shape of a dark unicorn.  A note has

been pierced through the center by the blade, carefully though so as to not

actually pierce even a single letter.

"
E
"note"
"Greetings travellers,


It has been quite some time since I travelled through the human lands, or in

fact any of the lands that you, the reader, are likely to know.  The gods

themselves have decreed that my family not return at this time, however that

does not stop me from interacting with the world that you know.  You may ask,

who I am, of that few of you no doubt have met me, on the rare instance that

someone reading this letter were once a friend of mine or my sister's, then I

beseech thee to have patience as we will meet again, or we will meet for the

first time.


Many years have passed, and many things have changed...  some bad, some good

yet the world travels on.  Very few things could possibly happen that would

require my intervention, as my time is best spent on other matters far from

Medienne.  There is one instance however, that I can no longer stand idly by

and allow to remain.


Once, long ago, I had a stronghold commissioned, a beacon to study...  it was

known only as The Training Grounds, where people of all races, all abilities

could come to learn, to hone their skills or simply to enjoy each others

company.  Long had this compound sat, as no-one not of my family possessed

either the key or the power to enter.  However times have changed, it seems

that a group laid siege to my stronghold and managed to bypass its defenses.

They now sit comfortably in that which I had created.  This is not to be...


I seek adventurers to ferret out those that live within its confines without

permission, I can offer two things, my thanks when you are successful and any

of the riches that we, its rightful owners left behind.  I have asked Jeremy

to assist in this matter in the ways that he is able, that being said he has

obviously posted this note somewhere accessible and he retains a few copies of

the key that will allow you through the main gates.


                            - The Spiritual Hammer

                            - The Black Rose


"
