"Some Tent Houses"
"This place is obviously home to the poorest of the poor of Medienne.  It

couldn't even be called a house, for the walls and ceiling are made of canvas

held up by the minimum of poles.  The floor is just dirt, which quickly turns

to sticky mud during wet weather, and the small amount of furniture here isn't

even up to the standards of second-hand shops.  It is amazing that anyone

could survive here for long, but it seems quite a few people do exist in this

pitiful place.

