#169
"Abandoned Storage Room"
"Wooden shipping crates are scattered in disarray, their tops pried off and

discarded in a splintered heap in one corner.  A few empty canvas bags lie on

the floor; a leak in the roof has let water drip onto them and they are

blackened with mold and mildew.  There is one rickety table left standing in

the middle of the room, the top littered with a few crumpled and water-stained

papers that were left behind.  The single door leading out of the room was

removed, leaving only the empty frame.  Someone bricked up the door from the

outside, effectively sealing this room off forever from those within the rest

of the building.  The window was boarded up from inside this room; a board on

the bottom has warped and bent away from the others.

"
"[Adelyth] Flagged no.magic so folks can't get summoned to here.

[Caer] The note item that pops with the clue to start the quest will be obj vnum 3632 (crumpled bill of lading).

[Caer] action search/read papers stack

[Caer] Waiting for cflags re: quest before implementing code for search/read

"
