#171
"Upon the Rooftop"
"From this vantage point, you can see down each direction of Manor Road.  A

plain stone wall rises up from the street level and ends just about three feet

above the rooftop you are standing upon.  The top of the leatherworker's shop

rises to the west of you.  The windows are all broken out and it looks as if

they have been boarded up from inside.

"
"[Adelyth] Climb skill on acode 1 set at 1 on purpose.  If someone manages to bypass the climb check on the way up, I want to make sure they don't get trapped up here.

