"Great Hall of the Knights"
"The Great Hall consists of one large room with a vaulted ceiling high

overhead.  A raised, carpeted dais in the room's center gives a place for a

speaker to stand when addressing a gathering.  Simple openings set in the

east, west and south walls lead to other small rooms set aside for the

Knights.  An ornate arch to the north leads back out to the Entry Hall.

