#176
"Knight's Stables"
"The odors of hay and horse are the first and most noticeable things upon

entering this room.  Several wooden stalls line the walls, places for the

mounts not yet in use to rest.  Each stall backs up against the stone walls of

the building proper creating this large side room for the stables.  The only

exit is a door large enough to lead horses out to the Entrance Hall before

heading further onward into the city.  A low ceiling, however, leaves too

little clearance to actually sit atop a mount and any mount would need to be

walked out before mounting it.

