#178
"Knight's Armory"
"A simple display room set aside for the local armorer.  A small anvil rests on

a table against one wall, perhaps to help in banging out dents in plate armor.

A lack of forge and tools in general seem to indicate that the armorer brings

his armor in from elsewhere rather than crafting it here.  An open arch in the

eastern wall provides the simple room's only exit.

