against the southern wall of this small chamber.  A hand and a half sword is

firmly thrust into the stone, symbolic of Divine Justice, Algesa's divine

icon.  There are no other accoutrements in the chapel.  A simple opening in

the north wall provides exit into the Grand Hall.

