"Champions' Room"
"The simple walls of the tower have a warmer feel, aesthetically speaking, at

this level compared to the one below.  The walls have been burnished to a soft

reflective glow amplifying the warm torchlight about the room.  A couple

comfortable chairs have been left about the room, apparently for use by

whomever has interest in them.  One chair in particular on the south wall

appears to be reserved for a retired champion who seems to have made this his

daily haunt.  Sets of stairs spiral up and down to other locations within the

tower.

