#183
"Heros' Room"
"The burnished walls of the tower room are adorned with many trophies from the

fruits of other heros' labors.  Most notable among the trophies is the head of

an ancient red dragon set in a place of honor above the mantle of a fireplace

set in the north wall.  Overhead, the domed ceiling is painted in a night

scene depicting stars overhead and a tree line silhouette where the dome meets

the walls.  Along the southern wall a staircase begins providing egress lower

into the tower.

"
