features the constellation called the noble champion.  The sky itself is a

dark blue, lightening somewhat as it reaches the lower portions of the dome

all the way around where a black silhouette of the tree line at night is

visible.  Beneath the silhouette of trees the dark color fades to gray then

back to the soft white of the burnished walls before reaching eye-level.

"
E
"4 fireplace 1 north"
