#264
"Temple of Algesa - Vault of Knowledge"
"A high, vaulted ceiling is held aloft by many simple, large columns.  Between

the columns, the stone walls have been inset with niches that hold hundreds of

scrolls and books in various conditions.  Short shelves run in organized rows

throughout the room, interspersed with small benches and podiums for reading

purposes.  Tall candelabra spaced evenly about the room provide ample light to

see by.

"
"[Pheebar] As a familliar, I can browse and 'search tavern'

"
