#266
"Private Study"
"The walls of this room are lined from ceiling to floor with books and

tapestries.  Though it has no windows, the room is extremely bright.  Aside

from a long stone table and a plush, stuffed chair behind it, there is no

other furniture in the small, cozy study.  Set into the west wall is a large,

oak door with strange sigils carved both on and around it.

"
"[Dalthas] This woman probably should know something about the item she wants you to retrieve

